<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Patch>

  <!--
    WASTELAND_MECHANICS_BUILD_1 §4 — storm exhumation REUSES the MovingDunes
    mechanism (owner-ruled at WASTELAND_BEDAZZLE_SITTING_1; "no new mutator-churn
    tooling"). This file only BINDS the Wasteland into that engine, the way
    MovingDunes' own header says data packs do ("an ash field drifts grey on the
    same machinery. Biomes opt in one at a time"):

      1. adds a grey-ash RM_DuneMaterialDef (RM_Dunes_WastelandAsh),
      2. binds RM_Wasteland to it with DuneFieldExtension,
      3. gives the two fall-bearing storms a DuneWeatherExtension so a blow
         visibly re-deals the field.

    The ash storm's own sandRate lays the fall (Odyssey's sand grid); MovingDunes
    drifts it, buries loose gear under deep drift, and returns it when the wind
    shifts and the drift erodes — the exhumation lottery. The Cinderfelt
    germination on that fresh fall is this mod's own C#
    (RM_MapComponent_WastelandStorms).

    Guard: every type named below (RM_DuneMaterialDef, DuneFieldExtension,
    DuneWeatherExtension) lives in the MovingDunes assembly, so a def or
    extension naming them without that mod loaded would be DISCARDED at load.
    Hence the whole binding is added BY PATCH, inside PatchOperationFindMod on
    the mod's <name> ("Moving Dunes", its About.xml) — never a top-level
    MayRequire, which is inert on an <Operation>. Absent MovingDunes, nothing
    is added and the storms still dose, pollute and seed; they just do not drift.
    The biome and weather defs targeted are this mod's own, so the xpaths
    always match when the FindMod matches.
  -->

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Moving Dunes</li>
      <li>RimMandrake: Baroque Biomes</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>

        <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
          <xpath>Defs</xpath>
          <value>
            <RimMandrake.MovingDunes.RM_DuneMaterialDef>
              <defName>RM_Dunes_WastelandAsh</defName>
              <label>settled fallout ash</label>
              <description>Centuries of deposition: fine, grey, radiologically live ash. Lifts in any real wind, banks against anything that stands, and gives back what it buried when the wind turns.</description>
              <tint>(0.62,0.62,0.60)</tint>
              <tintMode>MaterialColor</tintMode>
              <crestShading>0.2</crestShading>
              <slabSize>0.05</slabSize>
              <hopRange>2~7</hopRange>
              <erodeMinDepth>0.1</erodeMinDepth>
              <windSpeedThreshold>0.7</windSpeedThreshold>
              <shadowRange>4</shadowRange>
              <attemptsPerCellPerDay>5</attemptsPerCellPerDay>
              <stormTransportFactor>6</stormTransportFactor>
              <ambientDecayFactor>0</ambientDecayFactor>
              <influxLossRatio>0.9</influxLossRatio>
              <influxPerDay>10</influxPerDay>
              <weatherInfluxFactor>5</weatherInfluxFactor>
              <maxTotalMassFraction>0.3</maxTotalMassFraction>
              <burialDepth>0.55</burialDepth>
              <revealDepth>0.25</revealDepth>
              <minBurialMarketValue>5</minBurialMarketValue>
              <maxCachesPerMap>400</maxCachesPerMap>
              <plantChokeDepth>0.5</plantChokeDepth>
              <plantChokeDays>4</plantChokeDays>
              <plantChokeSampleFraction>0.125</plantChokeSampleFraction>
              <depositFilthDef>Filth_Ash</depositFilthDef>
              <depositFilthChance>0.01</depositFilthChance>
              <windShiftMeanDays>5</windShiftMeanDays>
              <windShiftBigChance>0.3</windShiftBigChance>
            </RimMandrake.MovingDunes.RM_DuneMaterialDef>
          </value>
        </li>

        <li Class="PatchOperationAddModExtension">
          <xpath>Defs/BiomeDef[defName="RM_Wasteland"]</xpath>
          <value>
            <li Class="RimMandrake.MovingDunes.DuneFieldExtension">
              <material>RM_Dunes_WastelandAsh</material>
            </li>
          </value>
        </li>

        <li Class="PatchOperationAddModExtension">
          <xpath>Defs/WeatherDef[defName="RM_WastelandAshStorm"]</xpath>
          <value>
            <li Class="RimMandrake.MovingDunes.DuneWeatherExtension">
              <transportFactor>6</transportFactor>
              <influxFactor>5</influxFactor>
            </li>
          </value>
        </li>

        <li Class="PatchOperationAddModExtension">
          <xpath>Defs/WeatherDef[defName="RM_WastelandPlasmaStorm"]</xpath>
          <value>
            <li Class="RimMandrake.MovingDunes.DuneWeatherExtension">
              <transportFactor>8</transportFactor>
              <influxFactor>6</influxFactor>
            </li>
          </value>
        </li>

      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
